ter again? This time, I would love if you could draw Lumi in a summer casual outfit at the beach! \n\nPlease draw something like these outfits: https://imgur.com/a/3RzaaXa\nI'm sure anything you do will look cute! \n\nI would love to use this on Youtube and Twitter as before. Please include a psd file with the character separated from the background. If possible I would like the character to not be cut off in the frame as much as possible. Thank you so much for considering!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16XqDP1fN_MXRJfLp2fGDSoojW--V3Hbo?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mochi_ggg/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b16102db/uploads/origins/0c50180c-dfa6-4f4e-bb7d-dd06f7199ce3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcddc42ca6d2c5cd906108b07616b551", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b16102db/uploads/origins/0c50180c-dfa6-4f4e-bb7d-dd06f7199ce3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fcddc42ca6d2c5cd906108b07616b551, https://si.imgix.net/b16102db/uploads/origins/0c50180c-dfa6-4f4e-bb7d-dd06f7199ce3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be3e1b1b05d4589a5d1c1929a0bf2779 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b16102db/uploads/origins/0c50180c-dfa6-4f4e-bb7d-dd06f7199ce3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=af9ec166e5320e4ec46be4d848449be8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mochi_ggg/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1a20d32/upload